            "description": "After many comments and complaints of the official Pokemon Go section being filled with botting and cheating discussion, Omniscient has created a section dedicated to just botting and cheating discussions which will filter out a lot of the legitimate player talk in the main section. The official section is called Pokemon Go Botting and Cheats with the description \"If you're a player that likes shortcuts then figure out and help others cheat at Pokemon Go in this forum.\" .",
